{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>著名中文媒體應用「iDaily·每日環球視野」</p>\n<p>=特別亮點=</p>\n<p>1.iPhone Duo 內屏橫屏：全新沉浸模式，</p>\n<p>2.iPhone Duo 外屏：輕盈閲讀模式，瀏覽更輕鬆；</p>\n<p>3.支持 iOS 27 新一代 Liquid Glass 液態界面；</p>\n<p>限時免費中，你現在就可以直接通過 App Store 下載：</p>\n<p>\n<img alt=\"20261022_duo_idaily_01.png\" src=\"https://static.cnbetacdn.com/article/2026/1022/6297aa7d8970c88.png\">\n</p>\n<p>\n<img alt=\"20261022_duo_idaily_02.png\" src=\"https://static.cnbetacdn.com/article/2026/1022/664fafa3b370d4c.png\">\n</p>\n<p>\n<img alt=\"20261022_duo_idaily_03.png\" src=\"https://static.cnbetacdn.com/article/2026/1022/31041861022153d.png\">\n</p>\n<p>\n<img alt=\"20261022_duo_idaily_04.png\" src=\"https://static.cnbetacdn.com/article/2026/1022/31b983ae0a3e9f7.png\">\n</p>\n<p>\n<img alt=\"20261022_duo_idaily_05.png\" src=\"https://static.cnbetacdn.com/article/2026/1022/f30036b59d5b99a.png\">\n</p>\n<p>\n<img alt=\"20261022_duo_idaily_06.png\" src=\"https://static.cnbetacdn.com/article/2026/1022/041e9271bb2351f.png\">\n</p>\n<p>\n<img alt=\"20261022_duo_idaily_07.png\" src=\"https://static.cnbetacdn.com/article/2026/1022/5212a34d95d8cbf.png\">\n</p>\n<p>關於 iDaily Media</p>\n<p>全球領先的移動互聯網科技公司，為超過4.8億 iOS &amp; Android 用户服務。</p>\n\n<p>=特別亮點=</p>\n\n\n\n\n<p>\n<img alt=\"20261022_duo_idaily_01.png\" src=\"https://static.cnbetacdn.com/article/2026/1022/6297aa7d8970c88.png\">\n</p>\n<p>\n<img alt=\"20261022_duo_idaily_02.png\" src=\"https://static.cnbetacdn.com/article/2026/1022/664fafa3b370d4c.png\">\n</p>\n<p>\n<img alt=\"20261022_duo_idaily_03.png\" src=\"https://static.cnbetacdn.com/article/2026/1022/31041861022153d.png\">\n</p>\n<p>\n<img alt=\"20261022_duo_idaily_04.png\" src=\"https://static.cnbetacdn.com/article/2026/1022/31b983ae0a3e9f7.png\">\n</p>\n<p>\n<img alt=\"20261022_duo_idaily_05.png\" src=\"https://static.cnbetacdn.com/article/2026/1022/f30036b59d5b99a.png\">\n</p>\n<p>\n<img alt=\"20261022_duo_idaily_06.png\" src=\"https://static.cnbetacdn.com/article/2026/1022/041e9271bb2351f.png\"